      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.92 (up from ₹1.35 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹48.3m (up 53% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹7.75m (up 42% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 16% (down from 17% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
